WEBVTT

00:00:04.060 --> 00:00:06.990
That took longer than I thought.

00:00:06.990 --> 00:00:09.150
Wonder if the old woman's still alive...

00:00:09.560 --> 00:00:12.350
We're only late because you 
wanted to go to that amusement park

00:00:12.350 --> 00:00:14.040
and wouldn't take no for an answer.

00:00:14.260 --> 00:00:17.860
Hey, that was just a dad trying 
to do something nice for his family.

00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:25.410
Nagisa, sorry, but could 
you wait here for a minute?

00:00:25.410 --> 00:00:28.050
Sure, but why, Gajou-kun?

00:00:28.410 --> 00:00:31.720
The old woman might be pissed 
'cause we made her wait.

00:00:31.720 --> 00:00:33.740
I'll go in first and calm her down.

00:00:38.830 --> 00:00:40.470
Oh, yeah.

00:00:40.470 --> 00:00:43.200
Gotta send Kojou-kun a message 
to let him know we made it.

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:46.150
Oh, that's right... This place...

00:00:47.740 --> 00:00:48.860
Come on out.

00:00:51.010 --> 00:00:52.640
If you don't...

00:00:58.130 --> 00:00:59.940
Mock space-severing?!

00:01:00.240 --> 00:01:04.410
That's Der Freischütz... 
no, it's Rosen Chevalier Plus, isn't it?

00:01:11.890 --> 00:01:13.760
Freikugel Plus?!

00:01:13.900 --> 00:01:15.710
Damn! That thing's power is...

00:01:27.250 --> 00:01:29.490
Shit... I'm paralyzed?

00:01:35.270 --> 00:01:37.510
It drowned out the whistling 
signal arrow's sound?!

00:01:37.510 --> 00:01:40.990
How can sound magic be defeated 
by such primitive means?

00:01:41.280 --> 00:01:45.460
Sheesh. A kid like you shouldn't be 
waving that deadly thing around.

00:01:46.020 --> 00:01:47.670
I'll have to punish you.

00:01:48.660 --> 00:01:50.170
W-Wait!

00:01:55.940 --> 00:01:56.640
Yuiri!

00:01:56.880 --> 00:01:58.880
You bastard!

00:01:59.570 --> 00:02:00.850
Sheesh.

00:02:00.850 --> 00:02:05.300
This wouldn't have happened if you weren't 
waving murder weapons around, kid.

00:02:11.520 --> 00:02:15.660
Are you in any position to 
talk down to others, amateur?

00:02:15.920 --> 00:02:17.360
Damn it.

00:02:19.740 --> 00:02:21.790
This really ain't my day.

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:28.080
Kojou-kun

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:28.080
Error sending message

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:28.080
An error occurred while sending this message. It 
may have timed out due to instability in the server or network connection.

00:04:01.060 --> 00:04:02.520
Hey, Yuiri-chan!

00:04:02.660 --> 00:04:04.320
Is breakfast ready yet?

00:04:04.320 --> 00:04:07.760
Don't address me as if we know each oth—

00:04:07.760 --> 00:04:10.300
Wait, why are you topless?!

00:04:10.690 --> 00:04:12.470
So I can work out.

00:04:12.470 --> 00:04:15.630
Wanna join me so you can feel good, too?

00:04:16.550 --> 00:04:19.030
Feel... good?

00:04:21.920 --> 00:04:25.360
Stop trying to seduce Yuiri, you animal!

00:04:26.420 --> 00:04:27.870
Shio-chan?

00:04:27.980 --> 00:04:28.760
Ooh!

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:29.790
Mine!

00:04:31.350 --> 00:04:33.580
Huh? What's wrong?

00:04:35.440 --> 00:04:36.960
Shut up!

00:04:39.890 --> 00:04:43.810
Huh, the Self-Defense Force is on the move?

00:04:44.560 --> 00:04:45.690
So it's time, then.

00:04:46.960 --> 00:04:50.040
If they're working with the 
Lion King Organization,

00:04:50.040 --> 00:04:53.120
it must be Narashino's Special
Attack Mage Regiment.

00:04:53.120 --> 00:04:55.680
It'd be led by one of the Three Saints...

00:04:55.860 --> 00:04:58.050
and I'm guessing they're after Avalon 
at the bottom of Lake Kannawa?

00:04:58.050 --> 00:04:59.410
H-How did you know that?

00:05:00.160 --> 00:05:02.880
JSDF military rations, type 1.

00:05:02.880 --> 00:05:07.340
I actually love the pickled daikon 
and chicken with rice in these.

00:05:09.170 --> 00:05:12.800
I see you are as impertinent as ever, Gajou.

00:05:12.800 --> 00:05:15.280
Who is it you take after, I wonder?

00:05:16.810 --> 00:05:18.320
Hisano-sama!

00:05:20.080 --> 00:05:24.090
Finally showed yourself, eh, 
you old snake-hag yokai?

00:05:24.090 --> 00:05:26.670
Who are you calling a yokai? Such insolence.

00:05:27.180 --> 00:05:31.360
Gajou, how much do you remember

00:05:31.360 --> 00:05:33.270
about your children,

00:05:33.270 --> 00:05:35.630
Kojou and Nagisa?

00:05:39.360 --> 00:05:42.040
Your memories have indeed been devoured.

00:05:42.250 --> 00:05:46.990
An aftereffect of the Blazing Banquet... 
the Fourth Progenitor's resurrection.

00:05:50.150 --> 00:05:52.960
What the hell do you know, you old hag?!

00:05:55.240 --> 00:06:00.300
Hikawa Shio, you will continue to 
observe him until the ritual is over.

00:06:00.590 --> 00:06:03.840
Haba Yuiri, you will come with me.

00:06:03.940 --> 00:06:04.990
Yes, ma'am.

00:06:06.480 --> 00:06:08.940
Did you say... "ritual"?

00:06:10.150 --> 00:06:13.480
Hey! What are you guys 
planning to use Nagisa for?!

00:06:13.830 --> 00:06:17.680
The very same thing you tried to do, Gajou.

00:06:18.510 --> 00:06:21.640
We will kill Avrora Florestina...

00:06:22.420 --> 00:06:25.140
completely, this time.

00:06:27.160 --> 00:06:29.660
This feels great.

00:06:29.760 --> 00:06:32.400
Hot springs really are the best.

00:06:32.400 --> 00:06:34.860
Nothing beats a morning bath.

00:06:34.860 --> 00:06:38.140
Too bad Yukina-chan and the 
other girls couldn't come along.

00:06:38.140 --> 00:06:40.610
I bet Kojou-kun's worried, too.

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:43.040
Where'd my phone go, anyway?

00:06:43.040 --> 00:06:45.290
And Gajou-kun still isn't back...

00:06:45.730 --> 00:06:50.360
Grandma was all gung-ho about relaxing 
with a bath to start the new year,

00:06:50.360 --> 00:06:52.800
but it's kinda lonely when 
I'm the only one here.

00:06:52.800 --> 00:06:58.010
Oh, right... Last time I was here, 
I got in with Kojou-kun.

00:06:58.850 --> 00:07:02.330
I guess there's no way we could do that now...

00:07:06.030 --> 00:07:09.130
Ouch...

00:07:12.860 --> 00:07:14.990
I-I'm so sorry!

00:07:14.990 --> 00:07:17.330
Forgive me! I'm so sorry!

00:07:17.840 --> 00:07:19.960
H-Huge...

00:07:21.520 --> 00:07:25.260
I'm so ashamed that you 
had to see me like this.

00:07:25.400 --> 00:07:27.440
R-Really, it's no problem...

00:07:27.440 --> 00:07:30.230
M-My name is Shirona.

00:07:30.460 --> 00:07:32.080
Kuraki Shirona.

00:07:32.080 --> 00:07:33.440
May I join you?

00:07:33.440 --> 00:07:36.060
Oh, sure! Feel free!

00:07:39.100 --> 00:07:43.090
So you're not actually 
here all the time, huh?

00:07:43.090 --> 00:07:46.430
That's right. I'm only staying here for now.

00:07:47.680 --> 00:07:49.000
The waves...

00:07:49.000 --> 00:07:50.190
Um...

00:07:51.600 --> 00:07:55.080
Would you like to touch them?

00:07:55.080 --> 00:07:57.980
Huh? I can? Are you sure?

00:07:57.980 --> 00:08:00.580
Yes, if it would make you happy.

00:08:00.720 --> 00:08:03.790
Th-Then... don't mind if I do!

00:08:11.190 --> 00:08:12.700
Th-This is...

00:08:13.120 --> 00:08:14.320
They're so soft!

00:08:14.320 --> 00:08:17.120
And yet, they have such elasticity!

00:08:17.120 --> 00:08:20.490
It's like they're sucking my 
fingers right in! They're amazing!

00:08:28.390 --> 00:08:30.320
That was a close one.

00:08:30.320 --> 00:08:32.450
I could feel myself starting 
to fade for a second.

00:08:32.630 --> 00:08:35.850
A-Are you quite satisfied?

00:08:35.850 --> 00:08:38.120
Yeah! Thanks a lot!

00:08:38.120 --> 00:08:40.700
So... that means it's my turn now.

00:08:40.960 --> 00:08:41.840
Huh?

00:08:41.840 --> 00:08:43.590
Wait... Shirona-san!

00:08:44.410 --> 00:08:48.840
No, no. You don't get to do 
all the touching by yourself.

00:08:48.840 --> 00:08:51.840
Sh-Shirona-san, not there...

00:08:53.270 --> 00:08:56.420
This could prove to be quite 
a fun body to play with.

00:08:56.420 --> 00:08:57.800
And how about here?

00:08:58.570 --> 00:09:01.800
Shirona-san... s-stop!

00:09:07.860 --> 00:09:11.760
Shirona-san... are you...

00:09:12.690 --> 00:09:14.650
No need to be afraid.

00:09:14.650 --> 00:09:18.030
I am as a demon, but not a true demon.

00:09:18.350 --> 00:09:21.380
In fact, I am closer to what you are,

00:09:21.380 --> 00:09:23.780
Avrora the Twelfth.

00:09:23.780 --> 00:09:24.770
No...

00:09:45.120 --> 00:09:46.350
What's the status on Avalon?

00:09:46.870 --> 00:09:49.700
Its activation has already 
progressed to the critical stage.

00:09:49.800 --> 00:09:53.500
The density of the magic at the surface 
is 774 times the standard value.

00:09:53.500 --> 00:09:58.700
Its effects on the surrounding ecosystem may 
reach crisis levels within just a few days.

00:09:58.800 --> 00:10:01.500
We will bring the matter 
under control before then.

00:10:01.500 --> 00:10:02.660
Isn't that correct,

00:10:02.880 --> 00:10:04.030
Akatsuki-sensei?

00:10:04.290 --> 00:10:05.750
Yes, of course.

00:10:06.060 --> 00:10:09.600
Since ancient times, every time the 
Houda has shown signs of awakening,

00:10:09.600 --> 00:10:13.630
Kamioda Shrine has been there to silence it.

00:10:13.840 --> 00:10:14.960
Houda?

00:10:14.960 --> 00:10:18.930
Is that the name of the thing 
sleeping within Avalon?

00:10:19.130 --> 00:10:22.270
So say the ancient texts of Kamioda Shrine.

00:10:22.410 --> 00:10:26.390
It is because I know how to calm this beast

00:10:26.390 --> 00:10:29.680
that the Lion King Organization has 
allowed me to assist in this operation.

00:10:30.410 --> 00:10:32.280
Is this not so, Shirona?

00:10:33.740 --> 00:10:36.880
Of course, that must indeed be the case.

00:10:37.500 --> 00:10:38.800
Lady Kuraki...

00:10:39.000 --> 00:10:41.700
Long time no see, Major Azama.

00:10:41.700 --> 00:10:43.150
Nice to see you are well.

00:10:43.790 --> 00:10:46.930
Kuraki... of the Three Saints?

00:10:46.930 --> 00:10:49.210
Frankly, it surprises me

00:10:49.210 --> 00:10:52.400
that you would choose such forceful means.

00:10:52.540 --> 00:10:58.230
Unlike the other Saints, 
I do not work for the government.

00:10:58.230 --> 00:11:02.140
I will do what it takes to eliminate 
the threat of a holy war.

00:11:02.240 --> 00:11:05.530
Threat of a holy war... 
The weapon of mass destruction?

00:11:06.240 --> 00:11:09.280
What are your thoughts, Haba Yuiri?

00:11:09.280 --> 00:11:11.640
Huh? Y-You're asking me?

00:11:15.120 --> 00:11:19.740
Well... I don't think it's 
exactly a "threat"...

00:11:20.380 --> 00:11:22.110
You don't?

00:11:22.110 --> 00:11:27.200
I-It's just a feeling... a really 
vague hunch that I have...

00:11:27.610 --> 00:11:31.460
But I don't think Avalon 
itself is the calamity.

00:11:31.920 --> 00:11:34.360
It's just... sort of sleeping...

00:11:34.360 --> 00:11:36.090
So, well...

00:11:37.380 --> 00:11:41.970
Shirona, would you take 
her there in my place?

00:11:42.200 --> 00:11:44.570
Oh? Interesting idea.

00:11:44.570 --> 00:11:46.190
Very well. I shall.

00:11:46.300 --> 00:11:49.710
Huh? In your place, Hisano-sama? What?!

00:11:49.920 --> 00:11:53.300
Well, then... Is everything 
ready, Major Azama?

00:11:53.300 --> 00:11:54.160
Yes.

00:11:55.200 --> 00:11:57.300
Then let us begin

00:11:57.300 --> 00:12:01.810
the ritual to kill what was 
once the Fourth Progenitor.

00:12:10.960 --> 00:12:13.320
Wake up, Nagisa-san.

00:12:15.970 --> 00:12:18.060
Shirona-chan?

00:12:18.170 --> 00:12:21.120
Huh? What is this?! More of 
what we were doing before?!

00:12:21.120 --> 00:12:24.350
Please relax. We are in Lake Kannawa.

00:12:24.550 --> 00:12:27.800
I have separated your consciousness from you

00:12:27.800 --> 00:12:29.310
and brought it here.

00:12:29.840 --> 00:12:31.760
My... consciousness?

00:12:32.000 --> 00:12:34.640
Your body is on Lake Kannawa's altar.

00:12:34.640 --> 00:12:37.240
No... That's not me!

00:12:37.240 --> 00:12:38.020
Correct.

00:12:38.380 --> 00:12:42.690
She is the former Fourth Progenitor, 
Avrora Florestina...

00:12:43.180 --> 00:12:45.270
Avrora the Twelfth.

00:12:46.280 --> 00:12:49.780
I do believe you know her quite well.

00:12:51.600 --> 00:12:53.800
What are you going to use her for?!

00:12:56.060 --> 00:12:57.630
What is that?

00:12:57.770 --> 00:13:02.160
A barrier to seal the calamity 
that sleeps beneath Kamioda.

00:13:02.620 --> 00:13:06.370
The people in the Self-Defense 
Force call it "Avalon."

00:13:06.370 --> 00:13:08.860
A barrier? But...

00:13:08.860 --> 00:13:12.350
Yes, it has begun to activate.

00:13:12.350 --> 00:13:15.770
Which is why it must be silenced at any cost.

00:13:15.770 --> 00:13:18.640
That is the purpose of this ritual.

00:13:18.980 --> 00:13:20.560
Ritual?

00:13:21.720 --> 00:13:24.900
The Fourth Progenitor's bloodline 
was divided into twelve beings.

00:13:24.900 --> 00:13:28.090
Avrora Florestina was an artificial vampire

00:13:28.090 --> 00:13:31.850
created to seal away one of those twelve.

00:13:31.850 --> 00:13:33.840
In order to stop the calamity,

00:13:33.840 --> 00:13:36.210
she will be presented as an offering.

00:13:37.360 --> 00:13:39.560
She is already dead.

00:13:39.560 --> 00:13:43.240
Your power only keeps her consciousness 
here in the present age.

00:13:43.490 --> 00:13:46.430
So, in that sense, it is not a sacrifice.

00:13:46.840 --> 00:13:49.850
Also, by presenting her as an offering,

00:13:49.850 --> 00:13:55.830
you will be freed from the fate of cutting 
your own life short to keep her here.

00:13:56.010 --> 00:13:58.780
No... Don't do it, Shirona-chan!

00:13:58.780 --> 00:13:59.770
You can't do that!

00:13:59.960 --> 00:14:01.990
That thing isn't a seal!

00:14:02.060 --> 00:14:04.360
She's the one who's been watching over it!

00:14:04.760 --> 00:14:06.950
You can't wake her up!

00:14:08.250 --> 00:14:10.750
What... This is...

00:14:16.740 --> 00:14:17.770
No...

00:14:18.270 --> 00:14:19.450
Stop...

00:14:23.840 --> 00:14:25.300
Avrora!

00:14:25.640 --> 00:14:27.520
Don't!

00:14:29.440 --> 00:14:33.180
Huh? She didn't just take 
Yuiri-chan and not you

00:14:33.180 --> 00:14:35.860
because Yuiri-chan is better 
than you or anything, right?

00:14:35.920 --> 00:14:37.390
That's not true.

00:14:37.390 --> 00:14:40.970
My proficiency with spells 
happens to be a bit higher,

00:14:40.970 --> 00:14:44.540
but Yuiri was supposed to be 
the one to get a Schneewalzer.

00:14:44.540 --> 00:14:47.320
Oh, yeah? That's pretty incredible.

00:14:47.320 --> 00:14:50.830
Yeah. Yuiri really is incredible.

00:14:51.980 --> 00:14:55.300
You really like Yuiri-chan, don't you?

00:14:55.300 --> 00:14:58.000
Wha— Where did you get that idea?!

00:14:58.000 --> 00:15:02.080
Because you love her, it hurts to 
think you aren't good enough for her,

00:15:02.080 --> 00:15:04.250
so you want to work harder.

00:15:04.250 --> 00:15:04.880
Right?

00:15:04.880 --> 00:15:08.390
W-Well... yes, that's true, but...

00:15:08.580 --> 00:15:13.650
Ugh! Why am I getting life advice 
from an old man like you?!

00:15:13.650 --> 00:15:16.700
Ah, I love it! How bittersweet!

00:15:16.700 --> 00:15:18.390
You're adorable, Shio-chan!

00:15:18.390 --> 00:15:19.560
Shut up!

00:15:21.870 --> 00:15:23.860
A-Akatsuki Gajou?

00:15:24.730 --> 00:15:28.320
Hey, Shio-chan... doesn't the 
air in here feel strange?

00:15:31.550 --> 00:15:32.860
This is...

00:15:32.860 --> 00:15:35.720
Damn that old hag! Did she screw it up?!

00:15:36.250 --> 00:15:38.450
Wait, how'd you get the shackle—

00:15:42.830 --> 00:15:43.970
Restrict!

00:15:55.520 --> 00:15:57.810
A spellgun?! Where did you—

00:16:00.770 --> 00:16:02.640
What kind of power was that?!

00:16:03.180 --> 00:16:07.990
Twenty years ago, I wandered into 
some weird ruins in Central Asia.

00:16:09.620 --> 00:16:13.080
All the guys on the research team who 
went there with me were wiped out.

00:16:13.820 --> 00:16:16.920
I was the only survivor, but half of me

00:16:16.920 --> 00:16:19.040
is still there to this day.

00:16:19.600 --> 00:16:22.800
Of course... Akatsuki Gajou, 
the Netherworld Revenant...

00:16:23.450 --> 00:16:25.800
I paid a hefty price for it,

00:16:25.800 --> 00:16:29.060
but I can do neat tricks like this now.

00:16:32.220 --> 00:16:34.000
Shio-chan, use your bow!

00:16:34.000 --> 00:16:35.560
Blast 'em all away at once!

00:16:35.680 --> 00:16:36.640
No need to ask me!

00:16:37.570 --> 00:16:42.220
Authenticate! Freikugel 
Plus: Proto III, unlock!

00:16:42.220 --> 00:16:45.030
<i>Registered archer Hikawa Shio authenticated.</i>

00:16:45.030 --> 00:16:47.240
<i>Freikugel Plus active.</i>

00:16:47.500 --> 00:16:51.560
I, War Dancer of the High God, 
as a dancer of the Lion, beseech thee!

00:16:51.910 --> 00:16:53.360
Let there be light!

00:16:57.010 --> 00:17:01.280
Wow. That's a War Dancer of the 
Lion King Organization for ya.

00:17:04.300 --> 00:17:05.620
Yuiri...

00:17:28.240 --> 00:17:30.960
Getting older is truly a dreadful thing.

00:17:31.520 --> 00:17:34.330
Shamaness Akatsuki! Are you all right?

00:17:34.480 --> 00:17:38.280
I'm Lieutenant First Class Okiyama 
Mikage of the 1st Company.

00:17:39.140 --> 00:17:41.260
Major Azama is missing?

00:17:41.260 --> 00:17:42.410
Yes.

00:17:42.410 --> 00:17:45.210
Given the situation, he may 
have been killed in action.

00:17:45.600 --> 00:17:48.890
I have assumed the position 
of acting commander for now.

00:17:49.560 --> 00:17:51.110
I see.

00:17:51.590 --> 00:17:53.460
I am sorry, Hisano.

00:17:54.520 --> 00:17:57.840
I misjudged the true identity of Avalon.

00:17:58.160 --> 00:18:01.890
That girl, Haba Yuiri, was absolutely right.

00:18:02.440 --> 00:18:05.260
Avalon is not a seal at all.

00:18:05.640 --> 00:18:08.020
It has been using us.

00:18:08.440 --> 00:18:12.740
It has taken in the knowledge of every 
priestess that has ever been offered to it,

00:18:12.740 --> 00:18:15.360
all while awaiting the right moment.

00:18:15.890 --> 00:18:19.690
So what it wanted wasn't the spiritual 
power of those priestesses,

00:18:19.690 --> 00:18:22.210
but their knowledge?

00:18:25.030 --> 00:18:26.750
Why did this happen?

00:18:26.750 --> 00:18:29.870
I'd say even the old hag 
wasn't expecting this.

00:18:30.160 --> 00:18:31.010
Sheesh.

00:18:31.710 --> 00:18:35.760
Gotta get Nagisa back, at least, 
even if I have to push my limits a tad.

00:18:40.360 --> 00:18:41.870
Whoa, there!

00:18:42.380 --> 00:18:44.390
You okay, Shio-chan?

00:18:44.390 --> 00:18:47.900
I'm fine! I'm just fine, 
so put me down right now!

00:18:47.900 --> 00:18:51.200
You're so light. You eating enough?

00:18:51.470 --> 00:18:53.200
Anyway, that aside...

00:18:53.570 --> 00:18:58.120
Look. It's frozen right down to the bottom.

00:18:58.120 --> 00:19:02.170
But how? Only a Progenitor's 
Familiar would be capable of...

00:19:02.420 --> 00:19:06.230
Oh? Then that's probably 
exactly what happened.

00:19:11.830 --> 00:19:13.160
So you're awake?

00:19:14.770 --> 00:19:16.050
You are...

00:19:16.380 --> 00:19:19.260
Remember me, Sleeping Beauty?

00:19:19.720 --> 00:19:21.690
Why do you smile?

00:19:21.690 --> 00:19:25.250
I have no words of apology for you.

00:19:25.310 --> 00:19:29.280
Should you wish to scorn, resent, 
and curse me, I shall willingly accept it.

00:19:29.800 --> 00:19:31.570
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:19:31.570 --> 00:19:33.660
No one's holding anything against you.

00:19:33.930 --> 00:19:36.480
Not me, and not Kojou, either.

00:19:40.960 --> 00:19:42.240
Is Nagisa okay?

00:19:43.800 --> 00:19:47.000
The soul of the kind maiden is within me.

00:19:49.250 --> 00:19:52.080
Akatsuki Gajou, was that...

00:19:52.560 --> 00:19:55.820
Shio-chan, can you look after her for me?

00:19:55.820 --> 00:19:59.440
Sure, I can do that, 
but what are you going to do?

00:19:59.720 --> 00:20:02.550
Can't you feel it in the air?

00:20:02.750 --> 00:20:04.080
The air?

00:20:05.750 --> 00:20:08.000
Is... something there?

00:20:15.630 --> 00:20:16.400
It can't be...

00:20:19.580 --> 00:20:21.480
What the heck was that power?

00:20:21.480 --> 00:20:23.740
Wait... Nagisa-san?

00:20:24.100 --> 00:20:26.710
She's gone? I have to get back to HQ—

00:20:28.570 --> 00:20:30.930
They're acting like something's chasing them.

00:20:33.950 --> 00:20:34.750
Huh?

00:20:35.660 --> 00:20:39.780
Wh-Why are you naked?!

00:20:39.780 --> 00:20:40.810
Mi?

00:22:13.560 --> 00:22:14.720
Where am I?

00:22:15.040 --> 00:22:19.940
That's right... We were attacked 
by a girl in shrine maiden robes.

00:22:21.100 --> 00:22:23.720
That strange power she had...

00:22:23.720 --> 00:22:26.600
Both Himeragi and I were 
powerless against it.

00:22:27.210 --> 00:22:28.440
Oh, right! Himeragi—

00:22:33.690 --> 00:22:37.120
Oh, Senpai... Good morni—

00:22:37.870 --> 00:22:40.970
Senpai! Thank goodness you're awake!

00:22:40.970 --> 00:22:42.840
H-Himeragi? Hey...

00:22:42.840 --> 00:22:44.040
I see.

00:22:45.220 --> 00:22:48.600
You fell asleep next to him after 
watching over him all night,

00:22:48.600 --> 00:22:51.270
and you're even giving him a glimpse 
at your chest through your yukata.

00:22:51.530 --> 00:22:54.210
It feels annoyingly like 
some cheap romantic comedy,

00:22:54.210 --> 00:22:55.980
but perhaps I could learn from it.

00:22:55.980 --> 00:22:59.390
I suppose I should expect no less of a 
Sword Shaman of the Lion King Organization.

00:22:59.390 --> 00:23:03.410
Senpai! What are you doing in 
the same futon as Kisaki-san?!

00:23:03.410 --> 00:23:06.500
I have no idea! I just woke up here!

00:23:06.500 --> 00:23:07.240
Oh, my.

00:23:07.950 --> 00:23:13.080
Have you forgotten how you so thoroughly 
rubbed my breasts with that right hand?

00:23:13.490 --> 00:23:14.460
How cruel.

00:23:14.460 --> 00:23:16.010
Senpai!

00:23:16.030 --> 00:23:17.680
Y-Your... breasts...

00:23:17.680 --> 00:23:18.400
I'm kidding.

00:23:18.400 --> 00:23:19.850
That was a joke?!

00:23:19.850 --> 00:23:20.300
Yes.

00:23:20.900 --> 00:23:24.380
Do you even have any feeling 
in your right hand?

00:23:24.690 --> 00:23:27.040
Uh... Now that you mention it, no.

00:23:27.040 --> 00:23:29.750
Your right arm was nearly torn off

00:23:29.750 --> 00:23:34.010
because you were reckless enough to try to 
stop an activated Schneewalzer bare-handed.

00:23:34.490 --> 00:23:38.480
I'm sorry. This happened because 
I let her take Schneesturm Wolfin.

00:23:38.800 --> 00:23:41.250
You got it back, so what's the problem?

00:23:41.250 --> 00:23:44.820
For now, just fix your yukata, 
Himeragi Yukina.

00:23:47.730 --> 00:23:48.960
Still...

00:23:50.000 --> 00:23:53.120
I suppose I can say you held your 
own well against Paper Noise.

00:23:53.500 --> 00:23:54.910
Paper Noise?

00:23:54.910 --> 00:23:58.460
Yes, the head of the Lion King 
Organization's Three Saints.

00:23:58.460 --> 00:24:00.840
She's one of the most powerful 
attack mages in Japan.

00:24:00.840 --> 00:24:04.870
I see. No wonder she was so strong.

00:24:05.800 --> 00:24:08.640
By the way, Kisaki, where are we now?

00:24:09.510 --> 00:24:11.520
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:24:11.520 --> 00:24:13.350
Your room service has arrived!

00:24:14.800 --> 00:24:16.720
I've brought your meal for you.

00:24:16.720 --> 00:24:18.610
I'll give you a massage!

00:24:18.610 --> 00:24:22.800
You guys?! 
What are Vatler's maids doing here?!

00:24:22.800 --> 00:24:23.740
Actually...

00:24:24.160 --> 00:24:28.110
it was Lord Ardeal who saved us.

00:24:28.110 --> 00:24:31.080
Ugh... So we're on his boat right now?

00:24:31.080 --> 00:24:33.120
No, this isn't his boat.

00:24:36.470 --> 00:24:39.490
This is a Japanese hot spring inn!

00:24:39.490 --> 00:24:41.040
The Hakone hot springs!

00:24:41.040 --> 00:24:43.650
Less than twenty kilometers 
from Lake Kannawa.

00:24:43.650 --> 00:24:46.090
It's close enough to walk 
there if you wanted!
